-- a report that carries the situation it was taken in: the species, the situation, the warrant the number
-- rests on with an inhabitant of it, and the value. This is the correction the whole section asks of the
-- record, and it is four fields rather than two.
SReport : Type 0 → Type 1
SReport V = (k : Species) × (s : Situation) × (W : Type 0) × W × V
